  { q: 'What is the Best Answer Hub Hash Generator?', a: 'The Best Answer Hub Hash Generator is a free, browser-based tool that turns any text into a cryptographic hash. It offers SHA-256 by default plus SHA-1, SHA-384, and SHA-512, using the native Web Crypto API. Every hash is computed on your own device, so nothing is uploaded, and it needs no account.' },
