        <div class="callout sage"><div class="h">How to check any online tool in ten seconds</div><p>Open your browser developer tools, switch to the Network tab, then generate a hash. If the work truly stays on your device, you will see zero outgoing requests. Do this once with the Best Answer Hub Hash Generator and you can confirm your text never leaves your machine.</p></div>

